s. With my king still on e1 and Black having developed pieces (knights on c6 and e4), I need to castle immediately. Castling kingside (K: e1-g1) accomplishes multiple goals: it brings my king to safety, connects my rooks, and allows my h1 rook to potentially enter the game via f1 or g1. This is a fundamental principle - castle early to secure the king before launching attacks.\n\nAnswer: K: e1-g1"}
